        "date": "2026-11-20T19:23:46Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): place DXF profiles on the stock from the Stock page and a drop\n\nThe Stock page gets a \"DXF profiles\" group: \"Add DXF profile…\", and one\nrow per profile of the active setup with its placement (one MoveSketch),\nHide / Show and Delete. A .dxf dropped on the viewport takes the same\nImportDxf path; with no stock it is refused by name. A drawing without\n$INSUNITS opens the \"DXF units\" modal, which shows its size read in\nmillimeters and in inches and never guesses. The status line states the\nimport summary. The browser lists each profile under its stock, the\nviewport draws its chains on the stock top with open ends marked (lines\ncached by data and pose), and the operation page offers the setup's\nprofiles as the Source of 2D, plasma and wire EDM kinds.\n\nFixes #1863\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
